# Exact probability pair for the TrueSkill query:
#   observed perfB1 >= 98 and 77 <= skillA < 80
#   query = not(perfA1 > perfB1)
# Output order is (P(query = false), P(query = true)).
#
# Under the observations, perfA1 <= skillA < 80 and perfB1 >= 98, so
# perfA1 > perfB1 is impossible.

(nat2prob(0), nat2prob(1))
